w_m8nis_1f␀Let's get to the weapons cache, re-equip and find another way across that river.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m8conv_1a␀␀Sentries.  Dead ahead.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m8conv_1b␀␀Let's take them out.  Nice and quiet.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m8conv_2a␀␀There's a footbridge spanning the river.  If we can access one of these buildings, we should be able to make our way into the city center.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m8conv_3a␀␀The main door has been barricaded.␀␀␀␀¼␀␀w_m8conv_3b␀␀There has to be another way in. Keep moving.␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m8conv_4a␀␀Our weapons are on the boat down by the dock.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
