r_m8nis_2c␀So what else is new?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m8conv_5a␀␀What have you got?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m8conv_5b␀␀Tourist brochures, if you can believe that.  All the sights in Koslovosk, including Independence Hall.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m8conv_5c␀␀Not exactly a sat photo but it might come in handy.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m8conv_6a␀␀They're guarding the bridge.  We'll need to take those guys out.␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m8conv_6b␀␀I'm on it.  Just say the word.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m8conv_7a␀␀We've got snipers! Stay low!␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m8conv_7b␀␀More KRA at ground level!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m8conv_7c␀␀Take'em out before they pin us down!␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m8conv_7d␀␀Damn it! This is no good! We need to pull back to high ground.␀␀␀␀0␀␀t_m8conv_8a␀␀More reinforcements inbound!␀␀˜␀␀s_m8conv_8b␀␀Make every shot count!  We have to push through!␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m8conv_8c␀␀There's too many of them!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
